### Third-Party Data & Methodological Attribution (MapBiomas Venezuela)

This project references and builds upon open geospatial land cover and land use
(LULC) classification data inspired by the **MapBiomas Venezuela** initiative,
published under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)**.

- **MapBiomas Venezuela Reference**: Colección de Cobertura y Uso del Suelo de Venezuela,
  desarrollada colaborativamente por Provita, el Laboratorio de Sistemas de Información
  Geográfica y Modelado Ambiental (LSIGMA) de la Universidad Simón Bolívar (USB),
  Wataniba y la Red Amazónica de Información Socioambiental Georreferenciada (RAISG).
- **Official Portal**: https://venezuela.mapbiomas.org / https://plataforma.venezuela.mapbiomas.org

All scientific credits, original rasters, and classification methodologies of MapBiomas
belong to their respective authors and institutions under the CC BY 4.0 license.
